"image":"/brand/wildheart/photos/cacao-circle.jpg","alt":"Hands raising cacao cups together","modules":[{"sign":"capricorn","title":"Sovereignty","theme":"Your own authority, your own rules"},{"sign":"aquarius","title":"Sisterhood","theme":"Being met without competing"},{"sign":"pisces","title":"Flow","theme":"Tears, softness, letting it move"},{"sign":"aries","title":"Rage","theme":"Anger as life force"},{"sign":"taurus","title":"Pleasure","theme":"The senses, appetite, enough"},{"sign":"gemini","title":"Voice","theme":"Sound, saying it out loud"},{"sign":"cancer","title":"Mothers and daughters","theme":"Lineage, nurture, and what you will not pass on"},{"sign":"leo","title":"Radiance","theme":"Being seen and taking up space"},{"sign":"virgo","title":"Devotion","theme":"Caring for yourself as you care for others"},{"sign":"libra","title":"Desire and boundaries","theme":"Yes, no, and asking"},{"sign":"scorpio","title":"The Wild","theme":"The parts you were told to tame"},{"sign":"sagittarius","title":"Freedom","theme":"The life you want, out loud"}],"nowNote":"Two Circle Nights, a daily practice focus and an optional full moon ritual.","gatheringLabel":"Circle Night","gatheringNote":"every circle on the same module.","beats":[{"letter":"P","word":"Presence"},{"letter":"U","word":"Unite"},{"letter":"L","word":"Lead"},{"letter":"S","word":"Settle"},{"letter":"E","word":"Exhale"}],"ritualsLabel":"Next rituals","ctaLabel":"Visit this night","ctaHref":"/spaces/wildheart/circles","yearLabel":"See the year →","yearHref":"/spaces/wildheart/the-year","layout":{"spaceTop":"default","spaceBottom":"default","visibility":"desktop"}}},{"type":"Zigzag","props":{"id":"wh-home-circle-night","image":"/brand/wildheart/photos/sisters-shore.jpg","alt":"Women embracing on a grey shore","eyebrow":"Circle Night","title":"Every circle moves through the same *five beats.*","body":"list","lead":"Ninety minutes, every other week, in person. A woman can walk into any circle and know where she is.","items":[{"text":"P · Presence · Arrive in the body: breath, shaking, landing."},{"text":"U · Unite · A check-in round, each woman speaking and being witnessed."},{"text":"L · Lead · The module’s practice: movement, voice, ritual or teaching."},{"text":"S · Settle · Rest and integration, lying down, on the floor, quiet."},{"text":"E · Exhale · Close with sound, a commitment, and celebration."}],"mediaSide":"left","layout":{"spaceTop":"default","spaceBottom":"default","visibility":"desktop"}}},{"type":"WildheartSealCards","props":{"id":"wh-home-pillars","label":"The four pillars","heading":"Feel it, enjoy it, sound it, *play.*","columns":4,"cards":[{"glyph":"earth","title":"Embodiment","body":"Feeling the body from inside, not watching it from outside.","note":"Breath · shaking · grounding"},{"glyph":"venus","title":"Sensuality","body":"Pleasure through the senses, at her own pace.","note":"Slow movement · texture · scent"},{"glyph":"fire","title":"Voice and expression","body":"Taking up space with sound, words and anger.","note":"Sighing to roaring · saying no"},{"glyph":"sun","title":"Joy","body":"Play without purpose.","note":"Dance · laughter · games"}],"layout":{"spaceTop":"default","spaceBottom":"default","visibility":"desktop"}}},{"type":"WildheartRetreatBand","props":{"id":"wh-home-retreat","alt":"Tattooed hands and a fern pressed to a tree","image":"/brand/wildheart/photos/forest-witch.jpg","seal":"scorpio","label":"Samhain weekend · Oct 29 – 31, 2027","heading":"Three nights in the *wild dark.*","lead":"The year turns on the thinnest night. Every Wildheart circle gathers to honour what has ended, move what is held, and walk back into the light together.","days":[{"label":"Fri · Arrive","title":"The threshold","body":"Fire lit, circle cast, the first sound."},{"label":"Sat · Samhain","title":"The ancestors","body":"Movement, rage, release, and a night vigil.","accent":true},{"label":"Sun · Return","title":"The new year","body":"Rest, intentions, and joy 